        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dom Capers, Gary Kubiak\n- Teams: Houston Texans, Denver Broncos, Green Bay Packers\n- Roles: head coach, offensive coordinator, defensive coordinator\n- Topics: 2005 Houston Texans season, NFL expansion teams\n\nFacts:\n- Ernest Dominic Capers was born on August 7, 1950.\n- Dom Capers is an American football coach.\n- Dom Capers is the only person to serve as the inaugural head coach of two different NFL expansion teams.\n- The 2005 Houston Texans season was the fourth season in Houston Texans franchise history.\n- After the 2005 season, the Houston Texans fired head coach Dom Capers.\n- After the 2005 season, the Houston Texans replaced Dom Capers with Denver Broncos offensive coordinator Gary Kubiak.\n- Dom Capers is the current defensive coordinator for the Green Bay Packers of the National Football League.",
